.pdf</ext-link></comment></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="R15"><label>15</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Kopetsch</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>&#x000c4;rztinnen Potentiale werden (noch) nicht genutzt [The potential of female doctors is still underused]</article-title><source>Dtsch &#x000c4;rztebl</source><year>2003</year><volume>100</volume><fpage>891</fpage><lpage>895</lpage><comment>Available from: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.aerzteblatt.de/v4/archiv/pdf.asp?id=36308">http://www.aerzteblatt.de/v4/archiv/pdf.asp?id=36308</ext-link></comment></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="R16"><label>16</label><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><collab>Zentralstelle f&#x000fc;r die Vergabe von Studienpl&#x000e4;tzen [Central Office for the Allocation of Places in Higher Education]</collab><source>[Homepage on the Internet]</source><year>2009</year><publisher-loc>Dortmund</publisher-loc><publisher-name>ZVS</publisher-name><date-in-citation>cited 2009</date-in-citation><comment>Available from: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.zvs.de/">http://www.zvs.de/</ext-link></comment></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="R17"><label>17</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Strau&#x000df;</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Br&#x000e4;hler</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Der Kampf um die Besten: das neue Zulassungsverfahren zum Medizinstudium [Fighting for the best: the new procedure for the selection of medical students]</article-title><source>Psychother Psychosom Med Psychol</source><year>2005</year><volume>55(7)</volume><fpage>321</fpage><lpage>323</lpage><comment>DOI: 10.1055/s-2005-866922</comment><comment>Available from: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://dx.doi.org/10.1055/s-2005-866922">http://dx.doi.org/10.1055/s-2005-866922</ext-link><